% Approved product: docs/IMPLEMENTATION_REQUEST.md; evidence: docs/MODEL_PORT.md.
API: native/Include/claw_lm.h C ABI, error buffers, owning Rust wrapper; CUDA C++ runtime/numerics/model modules.
